id=tissot_newid
name=tissot New Google Device ID
version=v1.0.0-tissot
versionCode=10000
author=QunDev
description=On-demand "become a new device for Google" tool. Tap Action to reset the Google device identity (clears GSF/GMS/Play data -> new GSF & Android ID on next checkin, randomizes serial, refreshes PIF fingerprint from Google via autopif). Signs you out of Google; reboot + re-login after, and Google registers a NEW device. Boot script re-applies the spoofed serial AND auto-syncs the global device identity (model/brand/device/fingerprint + partition variants) to match PlayIntegrityFix's pif.prop, so global props always match DroidGuard (override with /data/adb/tissot_newid/profile.prop). Pair with PlayIntegrityFix(autopif)+TrickyStore. NOTE: same TrickyStore keybox => Google may still correlate via the attestation key.
